  'SALT':'盐','real licorice':'真甘草','very salty food':'很咸的食物','Very salty food and real licorice push blood pressure up':'很咸的食物和真甘草会让血压升高',
  'a blood vessel':'一根血管','holds extra salt and water':'多留住了盐和水','licorice beats the pill':'甘草压过了药','Licorice makes the body hold extra salt and water, pushing pressure up against her pill':'甘草让身体多留住盐和水，跟她的药对着干，把血压推高',
